{"id":"n62600-1-3","stage":1,"title":"물론 · 当然","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62600-1-3-1","ko":"오늘이 황사가 심하니 외출을 안 하시는 게 좋아요.","zh":"今天沙尘暴很严重，最好别出门。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘이","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘이","audio":"/audio/c4a432f0e61abb21e6b8.mp3"}},{"text":"황사가","meaning":"沙尘暴","explanation":"황사：沙尘暴；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"황사","audio":"/audio/baabf4a8b414e8e42bfa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87410","senseId":"2","lemma":"황사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"황사가","audio":"/audio/f0b66d9344e79bc5edf2.mp3"}},{"text":"심하니","meaning":"严重","explanation":"심하다：严重；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"심하다","audio":"/audio/a1212e5a4cc185542567.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65046","senseId":"1","lemma":"심하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"심하니","audio":"/audio/ec8588f66a266414538d.mp3"}},{"text":"외출을","meaning":"外出，出行，出门","explanation":"외출：外出，出行，出门；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"외출","audio":"/audio/b39546a26046f3d2c5d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67857","senseId":"1","lemma":"외출","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"외출을","audio":"/audio/a474a12d68c0df86cb48.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"하시는","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하시는","audio":"/audio/d053d0b8eea20c93e944.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"这件事、这种情况（것 + 이）","explanation":"게 是依存名词 것 和主格助词 이 的缩合，指前面修饰的事物、行为或情况，并把它作为主语；这里不是表示将来计划的 -ㄹ/을 것이다。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아요.","meaning":"方便，好","explanation":"좋다：方便，好；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"13","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아요","audio":"/audio/4e89f12afd275d8a286b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"baabf4a8b414e8e4","term":"황사","zh":"沙尘暴","audio":"/audio/baabf4a8b414e8e42bfa.mp3","entryId":"87410","definition":"中国大陆的沙子被强风吹来后落下的现象。","pronunciation":["황사"]},{"id":"a1212e5a4cc18554","term":"심하다","zh":"严重","audio":"/audio/a1212e5a4cc185542567.mp3","entryId":"65046","definition":"程度过头。","pronunciation":["심ː하다"]},{"id":"b39546a26046f3d2","term":"외출","zh":"外出，出行，出门","audio":"/audio/b39546a26046f3d2c5d6.mp3","entryId":"67857","definition":"有事要干从家里或公司等地出去。","pronunciation":["외ː출","웨ː출"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"前面所说的行为、状态或事情","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"前面所说的行为、状态或事情","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"方便，好","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某事做起来很容易或很便利。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/28c565690603cae0579a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62600-1-3-2","ko":"물론 나도 알지. 그래도 나가야 돼.","zh":"我当然知道。但还是得出去。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"물론","meaning":"当然，不用说","explanation":"물론：当然，不用说。","readings":[{"term":"물론","audio":"/audio/86ee58f45cccde9947f0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62600","senseId":"1","lemma":"물론","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물론","audio":"/audio/86ee58f45cccde9947f0.mp3"}},{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나도","audio":"/audio/9630a018a2b2bf43a396.mp3"}},{"text":"알지.","meaning":"知道，明白","explanation":"알다：知道，明白；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"1","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알지","audio":"/audio/4b4875ebf5ca1b8e84a5.mp3"}},{"text":"그래도","meaning":"“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","explanation":"그래도：“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"그래도","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36264","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래도","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3"}},{"text":"나가야","meaning":"去","explanation":"나가다：去；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"22","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나가야","audio":"/audio/7d425cbb33a096457443.mp3"}},{"text":"돼.","meaning":"应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）","explanation":"되다：应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"18","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돼","audio":"/audio/9a156a11ed02d98f483a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86ee58f45cccde99","term":"물론","zh":"当然，不用说","audio":"/audio/86ee58f45cccde9947f0.mp3","entryId":"62600","definition":"没必要说地。","pronunciation":["물론"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"知道，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"通过教育、经验、思考等来，具备与事物或情况相关的信息或知识。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"82bd547e58bb6509","term":"그래도","zh":"“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3","entryId":"36264","definition":"“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"961ee88770fe6ab5","term":"나가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3","entryId":"71456","definition":"去做某事。","pronunciation":["나가다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a33017a6930fad31a96e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.857,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62600","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":51,"sequenceScore":2.2575,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我当然知道。但还是得出去。","今天沙尘暴很严重，最好别出门。","申请表上只要写上年级和班级就行吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["今天沙尘暴很严重，最好别出门。","申请表上只要写上年级和班级就行吗？","我当然知道。但还是得出去。"],"answer":2}]}
